name docshots
category Package
revision 69676
shortdesc TeX samples next to their PDF snapshots
relocated 1
longdesc This LaTeX package helps you show TeX code next to the
longdesc corresponding PDF snapshots, in two-column formatting. You can
longdesc use it either in .dtx documentation or in .tex files.
depend fancyvrb
depend iexec
depend pdfcrop
depend pgf
depend pgf-blur
runfiles size=2
 RELOC/tex/latex/docshots/docshots.sty
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/yegor256/docshots
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/docshots
catalogue-license mit
catalogue-topics doc-supp
catalogue-version 0.4.3
